---
/** Shown instead of gear content when `locals.supabase` is null (Supabase env vars unset). */
---

<div class="rounded-2xl border border-warning/40 bg-warning/10 p-6 text-sm text-foreground">
  <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-heading">Database not configured</p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
    Sidereus cannot reach its database, so your sites and gear cannot be shown or saved. Set
    <code class="font-mono text-heading">SUPABASE_URL</code> and{" "}
    <code class="font-mono text-heading">SUPABASE_KEY</code> and restart the server.
  </p>
</div>
